This is a comparative study carried out between the healthy ans MS (Multiple Sclerosis) condition.
Identification of Differentially Expressed Genes between the healthy condition and disease condition followed by the pathway analysis.
Application of Machine Learning Approaches for additional predicted values and comparision between the statistically generated and the ML - Model based genes.
Validation of the obtained Significant DEGs with an independent dataset.

#Tools Used
NCBI GEO Database
R
G:Profiler
NCBI GEO2R
Python
STRINGdb
Cytoscape
